WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.700
Hey Terminal. A keyboard-first terminal for iPad.
Type ssh demo at the local prompt.

00:04.700 --> 00:08.200
Connect to the demo server using SSH. Run ls.

00:08.200 --> 00:14.500
Run cat status.txt to read a file on the demo server.

00:14.500 --> 00:20.500
Press Command-T to open a new local tab. Run ls.

00:20.500 --> 00:23.500
Select the SSH tab to return to the existing session.

00:23.500 --> 00:27.700
Hey Terminal. A keyboard-first terminal for iPad.
